      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ray Cooke Lettings are delighted to introduce Barons Hall Park to the Balbriggan rental market. This ideally located 2-bed, ground-floor apartment is tucked away within the Barons Hall development, adjacent to a wide range of local amenities and excellent transport links.\nThe internal accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, two bedrooms, and a recently renovated bathroom. Further along the hall, you will find a bright and spacious open-plan kitchen/dining area and living room. Double doors open out onto a patio area.\nThis highly convenient location is within close proximity to the beachfront and only a short walk from Millfield Shopping Centre. Balbriggan town centre offers an array of amenities including excellent schools, restaurants, bars, cafés, and a cinema. The property is situated just 37 km north of Dublin city centre and 20 km south of Drogheda. The development also benefits from quick access to the M1 and is only 20 minutes from Dublin Airport.\n\nKey Features:\n• Spacious living accommodation\n• Quiet peaceful development\n• Recently renovated throughout\n• M1 Motorway within arm's reach\n• Fully furnished\n• LOCATION, LOCATION, LOCATION!\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
      },
